#. ~ Description of ".44 Magnum FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/44.json
msgid ""
"Jacketed .44 Magnum ammunition with a 240gr bullet.  The .44 Magnum round is "
"one of the most powerful handgun cartridges available.  It has excellent "
"stopping power but suffers from extremely high recoil for a handgun round."
msgstr ""

